<title>VENEZUELA: German, Mexican steel companies join forces.</title>
<headline>German, Mexican steel companies join forces.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>GAN International de Venezuela, a unit of Mexican steel company Grupo Acerero del Norte (GAN), has signed a commercial deal with Kloeckner Stahl und Mettall Handel GmbH, a unit of Germany's VIAG AG, to market steel products in Latin America.</p>
<p>Under the agreement GAN, which is the holding company for Altos Hornos de Mexico SA de CV, or Ahmsa, will represent Kloeckner in Colombia, Ecuador, Peru, Central America and the Caribbean, GAN said in a release.</p>
<p>Since its creation in 1995, GAN International de Venezuela has been responsible for marketing Ahmsa products throughout the Caribbean and Central America.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
